OL,3,AFlight chaos caused by 'millisecond'
OL,4,Asoftware defect, report says
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn air traffic control failure that
OL,7,Fsparked widespread travel chaos earlier
OL,8,Fthis month was caused by a "software
OL,9,Fdefect" affecting the system
OL,10,Funderpinning UK air space management,
OL,11,Fthe national air traffic service Nats
OL,12,Fhas said.
OL,14,FThe problem happened "in the space of a
OL,15,Fmillisecond", Nats said, leading to the
OL,16,Fsystem producing corrupted data.
OL,18,FThe failure led to more than 2,000
OL,19,Fflights being cancelled and hundreds of
OL,20,Fthousands of passengers affected, with
OL,21,Fsome sleeping on airport floors or
OL,22,Fgetting stuck overseas.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/38
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
